 // When xe_downscale_half_pixel_offset is set, samples from (scale/2, scale/2)
 // within each block to compensate for the half-pixel offset becoming a
 // full-pixel offset at higher resolutions.
+//
+// With xe_downscale_box_filter set, 8-bit-per-channel 32bpp data is instead the
+// average of every sample of the block, channel by channel, so that content
+// drawn at a higher resolution isn't aliased when it goes back to guest memory.
 
